# This directory is a shared workspace with several unrelated projects
# sitting alongside the real Orbit 360 site (see .gitignore for the full
# picture). Only this one file actually causes a live problem: a stray,
# untracked root-level index.html from an old pre-Orbit prototype shadows
# the "/" route ahead of vercel.json's rewrite to the real landing page.
# Everything else at the workspace root deploys unchanged (some of it,
# like the extra files under /api/, is real production code that isn't
# git-tracked here but must still ship) -- so this stays a single,
# narrowly-targeted exclusion rather than a broad allowlist.
/index.html
